<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορέας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span>: 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορίαις</span></b>  Ale.<i><span class="en">
			<u>Supp.</u>
			7.13
		</span></i>; 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορέης</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορῆς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έω</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			7.189
		</span></i>; 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορρᾶς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾶ</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Cratin.
			207
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Th.
			6.2
		</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Criti.</u>
			112b
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>PPetr.</u>
			1.21.11
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
			13.29
		</span></i>, etc.; but gen. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορέου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.373.29
				</span></i>
			:—<i>north wind</i>, personified as
			<u>Boreas</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.296
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νότος, Β. καὶ ἀπαρκτίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					363b14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mu.</u>
				394b20
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				612b5
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Β. πνέουσιν ὀρνιθίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHib.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			-. <i><span class="en">
				59
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the north</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς Βορέην</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῆν</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἄνεμον</span> towards <i>the
				north.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.101
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς Βορέαν τοῦ ὄρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.96
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορρᾷ</span>
			<i>to the north</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1127.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, etc.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορόην:
				τὴν φῦσαν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
